Key Themes for Exploration
AI Foundations: How is Agentic AI different from Generative AI in practice?
Agentic AI is an autonomous, purpose driven, uses external tools via API / MCP. It may be for single task or to execute an workflow with chain of agents. where generative models serve as the large brain with generating capability. Generative AI is acting as an internal "brain" for an agentic workflow
Python’s Role: Why is Python considered the “default” language for AI?
- Community support with massive libraries
- Simple - Human readable language
- Glue Architecture - Python connects, orchestrates, and bind together disparate software components, databases, and C/C++ libraries. Ex: NumPy. Interesting topic learned during assignment :). 
